# Hero loop: one Signal moving along the spine, as the TUI shows it:
# Inbox (Ideate) -> Chart (Defog) -> Checkpoint (Execute) -> the Graph map.
Output "/out/hero-loop.mp4"
Require mugicrew
Source /kit/settings.tape
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/demo && export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show
Type "mugicrew" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "2" Sleep 4s
Type "3" Sleep 4s
Type "4" Sleep 4s
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
